  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Moment of momentum is $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{r}} \\times \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{P}}$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{L}}=\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{r}} \\times \\mathrm{m} \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{L}=\\mathrm{mvr}=\\frac{\\mathrm{nh}}{2 \\pi}=\\frac{4 \\mathrm{~h}}{2 \\pi}=\\frac{2 \\mathrm{~h}}{\\pi}\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
